    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "“Cakaplah.”"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "“Cikgu sedar tak apa yang baru berlaku?”"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "“Apa?”"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "“Kita baru jumpa orang yang lebih besar daripada Ah Len.”"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Rizal mengangguk."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "“Ya.”"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "“Dan dia tahu siapa kita.”"
