    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Kemudian berkata,"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "“Kalau kau tak boleh, orang lain akan cari.”"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Rizal memandangnya."
